# The token `mise run release` makes the GitHub release with (see docs/development.md, decision 11).
# Copy this file to `.env` (ignored by Git) and fill it in; scripts/release.ts reads it from there and
# sends it only to GitHub's API, never printing it nor giving it to another program.
# `mise run release:dry` works without it (with it, it checks the token can read the repository).
# Never commit `.env`, nor put a token in any other file.

# A fine-grained GitHub personal access token for Federiker/donizetti only, with the repository
# permission Contents: read and write (which covers releases and their assets).
GITHUB_TOKEN=
